WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:02.868
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:04.270
We hope you're doing
well tonight.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.338
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:07.406
President Biden
sent a letter today

00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:09.776
to oil companies
and called on them

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:12.845
to produce more in order
to alleviate high prices.

00:00:12.845 --> 00:00:15.815
So if you needed more proof
that he's an old man,

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:18.585
he still thinks you can get
things done with a letter.

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:21.021
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:25.558
[ Applause ]

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:26.692
According to a new poll,

00:00:26.692 --> 00:00:29.295
President Biden's
approval rating is at 40%,

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:30.697
meaning that his approval rating

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:33.500
is the only thing
inflation hasn't touched.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.101
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:37.937
Republicans Senator Tom Cotton
reportedly met yesterday

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:39.839
with two dozen of his top donors

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:42.809
to discuss a potential
2024 presidential campaign

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:45.578
and said that former
President Trump's candidacy

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:46.946
wouldn't prevent him
from running,

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:48.348
only from winning.

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:49.949
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:52.318
After recent
congressional testimony

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:55.054
claimed that he was drunk on
the night of the 2020 election,

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:56.889
Rudy Giuliani tweeted yesterday

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:59.692
that he had refused all alcohol
that evening

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:01.394
and only drank Diet Pepsi,

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:05.064
although being drunk sounds like
the reason you give

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:07.333
for drinking Diet Pepsi.

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:10.235
"Dude, I was so
messed up last night,

00:01:10.235 --> 00:01:11.938
I drank a Diet Pepsi."

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:14.406
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.406 --> 00:01:17.009
The K-pop group BTS
announced yesterday

00:01:17.009 --> 00:01:19.178
that they're going on
an indefinite hiatus.

00:01:19.178 --> 00:01:21.214
Said President Biden,
"Aw, man!

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:23.316
They're gonna blame me
for this, too."

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:26.018
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.018 --> 00:01:27.687
Elon Musk tweeted today

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:29.956
that he just voted Republican
for the first time,

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:33.059
but only because there were
no candidates running as Sith.

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:35.995
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:42.935
Microsoft today formally
shut down Internet Explorer.

00:01:42.935 --> 00:01:45.671
Well, technically,
it just shut down itself

00:01:45.671 --> 00:01:47.206
and then they couldn't
restart it.

00:01:47.206 --> 00:01:49.875
[ Laughs ]

00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:52.812
A man in the UK recently
got a tattoo on his feet

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:55.281
that looks like a pair of shoes.

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:58.984
Said the man, "It hurt, but not
as much as the underwear."

00:01:58.984 --> 00:02:02.255
[ Gasps, laughter ]

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:07.994
"There's just so much white."

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:13.299
Authorities in Michigan
recently discovered

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:15.734
an alligator
in the front seat of a car

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:16.870
during a traffic stop.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.838
Even crazier, driver's side.

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:22.242
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:26.779
And finally,
a cooking duo on TikTok

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:28.047
set a Guinness World Record

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:30.415
by creating the world's largest
chicken nugget.

00:02:30.415 --> 00:02:32.619
Now, for the bad news.

00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:34.721
[ Crowd groans ]

00:02:42.529 --> 00:02:44.330
Scollins!

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:47.100
That was a monologue,
everybody.

